==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[cerebral]] [[cortex]]|cerebral cortices|pl2=cerebral cortexes}}

# {{context|neuroanatomy}} The grey, folded, outermost layer of the [[cerebrum]] that is responsible for higher [[brain]] processes such as sensation, voluntary muscle movement, thought, reasoning, and memory.

